{"slug":"setup-paperflow-cutover","title":"Barkpark as paperflow's Task Store — Cutover procedure (W7)","blocks":[{"id":"b1","type":"ingress","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Tested 2026-05-28. W7 flip: executed and verified live."}]},{"id":"b2","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Key facts (A3):","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" since 2026-05-28 "},{"type":"text","value":".beads/FROZEN","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" is set — tasks are "},{"type":"text","value":"type:task","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" documents in Barkpark's own Postgres; "},{"type":"text","value":"bd","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" is a shim over "},{"type":"text","value":"/v1/tasks","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". There is no separate goal/phase/event type: a \"goal\" is a root task (no "},{"type":"text","value":"content.parent_id","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"), a \"phase\" is ordered sibling tasks, nesting is recursive via "},{"type":"text","value":"content.parent_id","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"id":"b3","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Prerequisites"},{"id":"b4","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"type":"text","value":"Barkpark running on "},{"type":"text","value":":4000","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" — after the flip every "},{"type":"text","value":"bd","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" command routes through it"}],[{"type":"text","value":"paperflow installed + W7 binaries on PATH (see Step 2)"}],[{"type":"text","value":"LaunchAgent keeping barkpark alive on macOS (see "},{"type":"text","value":"docs/setup/SETUP.md","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":")"}]]},{"id":"b5","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Step 1 — confirm barkpark stays up"},{"id":"b6","type":"code","value":"kill <phx.server-pid>\ncurl -s localhost:4000/api/schemas | head -c 60   # must come back up"},{"id":"b7","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Step 2 — install bridge binaries"},{"id":"b8","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Copy to "},{"type":"text","value":"~/.local/bin/","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"text","value":"bd-shim","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"paperflow-flip-to-tasks","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"paperflow-flip-rollback","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"paperflow-import-bd","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"paperflow-doctor","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"paperflow-active-scope","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"paperflow-doc-meta","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"paperflow-mirror-phase","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"paperflow-dock-daemon","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"id":"b9","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Copy to "},{"type":"text","value":"~/.local/lib/","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"text","value":"barkpark-mirror.sh","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"id":"b10","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"bd-shim","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" is a "},{"type":"text","value":"bd","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"-CLI-compatible wrapper. It translates "},{"type":"text","value":"bd show/list/ready/update/dep","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" into barkpark HTTP calls and falls through to the real "},{"type":"text","value":"bd","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" for anything it doesn't handle. There is no "},{"type":"text","value":"epic","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" translation — goal/phase/event types and "},{"type":"text","value":"bd epic","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" were intentionally removed; close the root task with "},{"type":"text","value":"bd close <id>","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"id":"b11","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Step 3 — configure dual-write and verify readiness (7/7 gate)"},{"id":"b12","type":"code","value":"export PAPERFLOW_MIRROR_GOALS=1\nexport PAPERFLOW_BARKPARK_URL=http://localhost:4000\n~/.local/bin/paperflow-doctor --ensure-tasks --gate-for-flip   # must be ok:true, exit 0"},{"id":"b13","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"7 checks: "},{"type":"text","value":"barkpark_reachable","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"dual_write_enabled","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"active_goal_mirrored","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"importer_run_recent","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"orphan_task_count","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"shim_on_path","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"text","value":"gate_e_recent_run","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". All must pass."}]},{"id":"b14","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Step 4 — the atomic flip"},{"id":"b15","type":"code","value":"~/.local/bin/paperflow-flip-to-tasks --dry-run   # preview 6 phases\n~/.local/bin/paperflow-flip-to-tasks --apply     # the cutover"},{"id":"b16","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Phases: pre-flight gate → freeze "},{"type":"text","value":"bd","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" writes → import to barkpark (rate-limits are non-fatal, importer grinds through) → PATH swap ("},{"type":"text","value":"bd","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" → "},{"type":"text","value":"bd-shim","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":") → pointer repoint (noop, "},{"type":"text","value":"doc_id == bd-id","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":") → restore stock git hooks → verify + flag."}]},{"id":"b17","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Verify post-flip"},{"id":"b18","type":"code","value":"bd --version          # → bd-shim 0.1.0 → http://localhost:4000\nbd ready              # → live barkpark tasks\nbd list --json        # → task docs from barkpark"},{"id":"b19","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Rollback — one move (idempotent)"},{"id":"b20","type":"code","value":"paperflow-flip-rollback"},{"id":"b21","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Removes the "},{"type":"text","value":"bd","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" symlink, restores "},{"type":"text","value":"core.hooksPath","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":", removes "},{"type":"text","value":"FROZEN","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" markers. Original Dolt store is intact."}]},{"id":"b22","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Troubleshooting"},{"id":"b23","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"type":"text","value":"bd","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" commands error or hang","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" — barkpark is down. Probe: "},{"type":"text","value":"curl -s localhost:4000/api/schemas","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":". Restart: "},{"type":"text","value":"launchctl kickstart -k gui/$(id -u)/dev.pelle.barkpark","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}],[{"type":"text","value":"bd epic close <id>","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":" says \"not found\"","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" — expected and permanent. Close root tasks with "},{"type":"text","value":"bd close <id>","marks":["code"]},{"type":"text","value":"."}],[{"type":"text","value":"Import emits HTTP 429","marks":["strong"]},{"type":"text","value":" — non-fatal; importer continues."}]]}],"related":["setup-setup"]}
